        "si_used": false,
        "procedure": "A methanolic solution of Hmef (0.3 mmol, 73 mg) and MeONa (0.3 mmol, 16 mg) was stirred for 1 h to deprotonate mefenamic acid, then added dropwise to an aqueous solution of CeCl3·7H2O (0.1 mmol, 37 mg) and stirred for 1 h. The precipitate was collected by filtration and recrystallized from acetonitrile/DMF. Dark-red single crystals of complex 1 suitable for X-ray crystallography were obtained after one month (yield 22 mg, 30%).",
